{"seq":4,"slug":"modern-microstructure","title":"现代微观结构","docCount":3,"url":"/h/quantitative-finance/market-microstructure/modern-microstructure","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"dark-pools","title":"暗池与另类交易系统","url":"/h/quantitative-finance/market-microstructure/modern-microstructure/dark-pools","wordCount":2603,"readingTime":11},{"seq":2,"slug":"crypto-microstructure","title":"加密货币市场微观结构","url":"/h/quantitative-finance/market-microstructure/modern-microstructure/crypto-microstructure","wordCount":2876,"readingTime":12},{"seq":3,"slug":"market-fragmentation","title":"市场碎片化与最佳执行","url":"/h/quantitative-finance/market-microstructure/modern-microstructure/market-fragmentation","wordCount":3239,"readingTime":13}],"introMarkdown":"# 现代微观结构\n\n本章探讨 2010 年代以来市场微观结构领域的前沿发展。首先分析暗池和另类交易系统（ATS）如何改变了传统的交易所格局；然后考察加密货币市场的独特微观结构特征，包括去中心化交易所（DEX）和自动做市商（AMM）机制；最后讨论多场所交易环境下的市场碎片化问题，以及最佳执行（Best Execution）政策的实践与挑战。这些主题反映了技术创新和监管演进对市场结构的深刻重塑。\n"}